    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Obligation to act or omit to act in a way that affects a corporation's activities.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) The CDR provisions apply to a person if:  (a) the person is a corporation; or  (b) the person is not a corporation, but the person:  (i) acts; or  (ii) omits to act;  in a way that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the activities, functions, relationships or business of a corporation.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) The CDR provisions apply to a person if:  (a) the person is a corporation; or  (b) the person is not a corporation, but the person:  (i) acts; or  (ii) omits to act;  in a way that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the activities, functions, relationships or business of a corporation.";
