    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The action must be taken during the period when the intelligence becomes actionable scam intelligence for the entity.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The action must start on the day that the intelligence becomes actionable scam intelligence for the entity.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The action must end before 28 days after the entity reasonably believes that the activity is or is not a scam.";
