    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) The main objects of this Part are:  (a) to deter price exploitation in relation to the carbon tax repeal at each point in the supply chain for regulated goods; and  (b) to ensure that all cost savings attributable to the carbon tax repeal are passed through the supply chain for regulated goods.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(a) at (b)";
