    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies to an entity if the entity:  (a) is an electricity retailer that sells electricity to electricity customers; or  (b) is a natural gas retailer that sells natural gas to natural gas customers; or  (c) is a bulk SGG importer that sells synthetic greenhouse gas to SGG customers.";
