<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-deontic-1>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "forbid";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits supplying goods or services on particular terms and conditions before the applicable day.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person must not supply goods or services on particular terms and conditions before the applicable day.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/AllenInterval>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "during";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Describes the temporal relation between supplying goods or services before the applicable day and committing an offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The supplying of goods or services before the applicable day is during the committing of an offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-ltl-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-ltl-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LTL>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "until";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Describes the temporal relation between supplying goods or services on particular terms and conditions after the applicable day and committing an offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The supplying of goods or services on particular terms and conditions after the applicable day is until the committing of an offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::temporal_ltl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
