<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4>.
