    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Diffusion>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "if";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Describes the condition under which supplying goods or services before the applicable day leads to committing an offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The supplying of goods or services before the applicable day is if the person commits an offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::diffusion";
