    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Describes the relation between supplying goods or services of a particular description in a locality on particular terms and conditions and having a business notice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The supplying of goods or services of that description in that locality on particular terms and conditions is part of having a business notice.";
